## Post-Deployment URLs

After deployment, you'll have:

- **Application**: https://rehearsync.vercel.app (or your custom domain)
- **Health Check**: https://rehearsync.vercel.app/health
- **API**: https://rehearsync.vercel.app/api/v1/health
- **Edge Function**: https://[PROJECT_REF].supabase.co/functions/v1/replicate-webhook
- **WebSocket** (if deployed): wss://your-ws-server.railway.app

## Deployment Platforms

### Primary (Next.js App)
- **Platform**: Vercel
- **Cost**: Free tier available, $20/mo for Pro
- **Auto-deploy**: On git push (if configured)

### Edge Functions
- **Platform**: Supabase
- **Cost**: Included in Supabase plan
- **Function**: replicate-webhook

### WebSocket Server (Optional)
- **Railway**: $7/mo (recommended)
- **Render**: Free tier available
- **Fly.io**: ~$2/mo (256MB RAM)

### Database & Storage
- **Platform**: Supabase
- **Cost**: Free tier (500MB DB, 1GB storage)
- **Pro**: $25/mo (8GB DB, 100GB storage)

